--[[
	TRAINERS (v0.17): the people who teach you once you're grown (Engine/Training.luau).
	"Look for someone to train you" (Activities/Training.luau) brings one who'd take you on;
	their card (Events/Trainers.luau) is where you ask, or prove you're worth it. Then "Train
	with <them>" is in your activities until they've taught you everything: the stat they
	teach grows with every lesson (past 100 too), they teach their techniques at set lessons
	(City/Techniques.luau), and then limit courses raise your ceiling.

	Who teaches what follows the schools (City/Schools.luau): an Association's instructor
	only takes the Association's own (when.school), and teaches its status. Everyone else is
	somebody with no organisation behind them, teaching things that belong to nobody. All of
	these people are this game's own; none are canon characters.

	trainer = {
		id, name, short, role, stat,    who, and the stat their lessons grow
		gain = { lo, hi }, also = { stat = n | {lo, hi} },   what a lesson gives
		fee,                            Ahn a lesson (0 for your own Association)
		when,                           who can find them (conditions)
		accept,                         conditions to be taken on by asking
		test,                           the clash to prove yourself instead
		teaches = { { id, at } },       techniques, and the lesson each comes at
		limit = { per, every, times },  limit courses after the last technique
		text, line, set, art, yes, no, farewell, lessonLog
	}
]]

